---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Partner With Us | Constellation Marketing"
  description="Earn 10% recurring commissions referring law firms to Constellation Marketing. Over $100k paid out. Simple referral program — you make the intro, we handle the rest."
>
  <Header currentPage="partner-with-us" />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-badge">💸 Partner Program</div>
        <h1>Make Money With Us.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">We love paying referral fees. Over $100k already paid out to partners who simply make introductions.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="mailto:patrick@goconstellation.com?subject=Partner Program Application" class="btn btn-primary">Apply to Partner →</a>
          <a href="mailto:patrick@goconstellation.com?subject=Partner Program Question" class="btn btn-ghost">Ask a Question</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cards">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-rate">10%</div>
          <div class="hero-card-label">Every month, for life</div>
          <p class="hero-card-desc">10% of their monthly retainer, paid to you every month they stay a client. As long as they're with us.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-rate">Simply make the intro</div>
          <p class="hero-card-desc">Email, DM, or mention us on a call. We handle everything from there — the sales process, onboarding, and delivery.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-rate">100% transparent</div>
          <p class="hero-card-desc">You're in the loop at every stage. Monthly reporting on referrals, inquiries, and commission status — no black boxes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- More Reasons to Partner -->
  <section class="section reasons-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>More Reasons to Partner</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">We built this program for people who care about their credibility. When you refer a law firm to us, you're staking your name on the result. Here's why that's a safe bet.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reasons-grid">
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">💰</div>
          <h3>Commissions That Add Up Fast</h3>
          <p>10% of first-year contract value, paid Net-30. A single $5,000/month client earns you $6,000. Refer three and you're collecting $18,000 in year one alone.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">🏛️</div>
          <h3>We Specialize in Law Firms Only</h3>
          <p>We don't serve restaurants, e-commerce brands, or SaaS. Every client we work with is a law firm. That focus is why we get results others can't.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">🏆</div>
          <h3>We Deliver Results You Can Stake Your Name On</h3>
          <p>85+ law firm clients. Documented case results. We have the proof to back up every recommendation you make.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>We Do the Selling For You</h3>
          <p>You make the intro. We handle every step from there — discovery call, proposal, onboarding, and delivery. You don't need to know our pricing or pitch our services.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">✌️</div>
          <h3>No Conflicts, No Awkwardness</h3>
          <p>We're not competing with what you offer. Whether you provide coaching, CLE training, practice management software, or legal staffing — we complement, not compete.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reason-card">
          <div class="reason-icon">♾️</div>
          <h3>No Limit on What You Can Earn</h3>
          <p>There's no referral cap, no quota, and no exclusivity requirement. Refer one firm or fifty — every commission stacks.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="section steps-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">⚙️ How It Works</div>
        <h2>Simple Enough to Start Today</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">The whole process takes five steps — and only one of them is yours.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-list">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">1</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>You make the introduction</h3>
            <p>An email, a DM, a conversation at a conference — however you connect is fine. We'll give you a tracking link and a simple one-pager you can forward.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>We schedule a discovery call</h3>
            <p>Our team reaches out, schedules a no-pressure 30-minute strategy call, and assesses fit. If it's not a match, we'll tell you — and tell you why.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>We build a custom proposal</h3>
            <p>If there's a fit, our team creates a tailored proposal based on the firm's practice area, market, and goals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>They sign and we onboard</h3>
            <p>When they become a client, Constellation kicks off onboarding within 1–2 weeks. Your referral is in the system from day one.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-number">5</div>
          <div class="step-content">
            <h3>You get paid — every month</h3>
            <p>10% of their monthly retainer hits your account every month they stay a client. No chasing required — we pay automatically.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Commission Terms -->
  <section class="section commission-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">💵 Commission Terms</div>
        <h2>Straightforward. No Asterisks.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">One rate, no cap, no expiration. As long as the client stays with us, you keep getting paid.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="commission-layout">
        <div class="commission-rate-block">
          <div class="big-rate">10%</div>
          <div class="big-rate-label">of monthly retainer, every month they stay a client</div>
          <ul class="commission-list">
            <li>Paid monthly — as long as the client is with us, you get paid</li>
            <li>No cap — refer as many law firms as you'd like, commissions stack</li>
            <li>No exclusivity required — you can refer to other vendors freely</li>
            <li>Wire or ACH — your choice for payment delivery</li>
            <li>Monthly reporting on referral status and commission tracking</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="earnings-block">
        <h3>What This Looks Like in Practice</h3>
        <p class="earnings-sub">Our clients invest $1,000–$18,000/month. Here's what your ongoing monthly commission looks like — assuming they stay with us (they do).</p>
        <div class="earnings-grid">
          <div class="earnings-card">
            <div class="earnings-tier">Starter Client — $1,500/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-amount">$150/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-detail">$150/mo → $1,800/yr → keeps compounding every year they stay</div>
          </div>
          <div class="earnings-card earnings-card--mid">
            <div class="earnings-tier">Mid-Market — $3,000/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-amount">$300/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-detail">$300/mo → $3,600/yr → 3 clients like this = $900/mo passive</div>
          </div>
          <div class="earnings-card earnings-card--top">
            <div class="earnings-tier">Full-Service — $5,000/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-amount">$500/mo</div>
            <div class="earnings-detail">$500/mo → $6,000/yr → one referral, perpetual income stream</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who to Refer -->
  <section class="section fit-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">🎯 Who to Refer</div>
        <h2>Know Your Shot Before You Take It</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">We're selective about fit — which protects both your credibility and your clients. Here's who we work best with.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-grid">
        <div class="fit-col fit-col--good">
          <div class="fit-col-header">
            <span class="fit-icon">✅</span>
            <h3>Great Fit for a Referral</h3>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Law firm with annual revenue $500K–$2M+</li>
            <li>Wants to grow beyond referral dependency</li>
            <li>Frustrated that previous marketing didn't deliver</li>
            <li>In a competitive market where visibility matters</li>
            <li>Open to a 6–12 month engagement commitment</li>
            <li>Values data-driven results and transparency</li>
            <li>Practice areas with strong search demand (PI, Immigration, Criminal, Family, Estate)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="fit-col fit-col--bad">
          <div class="fit-col-header">
            <span class="fit-icon">⛔</span>
            <h3>Not the Right Fit (Skip These)</h3>
          </div>
          <ul>
            <li>Firms with under $300K in annual revenue</li>
            <li>Not currently interested in digital marketing</li>
            <li>Looking for one-time projects only</li>
            <li>Expecting meaningful results within 30–60 days</li>
            <li>Have a designated in-house marketing team</li>
            <li>Unwilling to invest in a real marketing budget</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Results -->
  <section class="section results-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">📊 Our Results</div>
        <h2>We Deliver What We Promise</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">When you refer a firm to Constellation, you're backing it with your name. Here's the proof behind the recommendation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-pills">
        <div class="stat-pill">
          <div class="stat-pill-num">85+</div>
          <div class="stat-pill-label">Law Firms Served Nationally</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill">
          <div class="stat-pill-num">Top 1%</div>
          <div class="stat-pill-label">Law Firm Marketing Agency</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-pill">
          <div class="stat-pill-num">3–10×</div>
          <div class="stat-pill-label">Typical ROI on Marketing Investment</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-studies-grid">
        <div class="case-card">
          <div class="case-tag">Immigration · SEO + Ads</div>
          <h3 class="case-name">Law Office of Tatiane M. Silva, P.A.</h3>
          <p class="case-quote">"She was investing heavily, but the results weren't clear. Constellation built a bilingual SEO + ads strategy that turned vague spend into a lead machine."</p>
          <div class="case-stats">
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">133</span><span class="case-stat-label">Leads/month at peak</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">SEO ROI</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">456</span><span class="case-stat-label">Keywords on page 1</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-card">
          <div class="case-tag">Immigration · SEO</div>
          <h3 class="case-name">Manji Law, P.C.</h3>
          <p class="case-quote">"Hiring Constellation Marketing was the BEST business decision I have made since opening my law firm."</p>
          <div class="case-stats">
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">568%</span><span class="case-stat-label">Increase in monthly leads</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">350%</span><span class="case-stat-label">Revenue growth</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">283+</span><span class="case-stat-label">Keywords on page 1</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-card">
          <div class="case-tag">Immigration · SEO + Web</div>
          <h3 class="case-name">Tadeo &amp; Silva Law — Atlanta, GA</h3>
          <p class="case-quote">"Constellation is phenomenal! They have helped our business grow significantly. — Massiel Silva Tadeo"</p>
          <div class="case-stats">
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">Qualified leads</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">278%</span><span class="case-stat-label">Total lead growth</span></div>
            <div class="case-stat"><span class="case-stat-num">60 days</span><span class="case-stat-label">To 7-figure run rate</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Deliver -->
  <section class="section deliver-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <div class="section-badge">🛠️ What We Deliver</div>
        <h2>A Complete Client Acquisition System</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">Constellation works exclusively with law firms investing $1,000–$18,000/month in marketing. Every engagement is built around one goal: more qualified clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-step">Step 1 — Immediate ROI</div>
          <h3>Advertising</h3>
          <p>Capture paying clients within 30 days. We build and manage high-converting paid campaigns for law firms in competitive markets.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Google LSA</span>
            <span class="tag">Google Ads</span>
            <span class="tag">Meta Ads</span>
            <span class="tag">Bing</span>
            <span class="tag">Retargeting</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-step">Step 2 — Pipeline Growth</div>
          <h3>SEO</h3>
          <p>Add hundreds of qualified leads every month through organic search. We build topical authority and local dominance for law firms nationally.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Local SEO</span>
            <span class="tag">Content Strategy</span>
            <span class="tag">Technical SEO</span>
            <span class="tag">Citations</span>
            <span class="tag">Link Building</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-step">Step 3 — Lifetime Value</div>
          <h3>Reviews &amp; Retention</h3>
          <p>Acquire Google reviews consistently and build a reputation that converts. Includes website design built to perform.</p>
          <div class="service-tags">
            <span class="tag">Web Design</span>
            <span class="tag">Google Reviews</span>
            <span class="tag">Email Marketing</span>
            <span class="tag">Social Media</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pricing-grid">
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <div class="pricing-label">Starter</div>
          <h3>Essential</h3>
          <div class="pricing-range">~$1,000–$2,500/mo</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Google PPC + LSA Ads</li>
            <li>Essential SEO (GBP + Citations)</li>
            <li>Reputation Management</li>
            <li>Automated Reporting</li>
            <li>Client Strategist</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card pricing-card--popular">
          <div class="pricing-label pricing-label--popular">Most Popular</div>
          <h3>Scaling</h3>
          <div class="pricing-range">~$3,000–$5,000/mo</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Elite Ads</li>
            <li>Elite SEO Level 1</li>
            <li>New Website</li>
            <li>Reputation Management</li>
            <li>1:1 Performance Reporting</li>
            <li>Dedicated Client Strategist</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="pricing-card">
          <div class="pricing-label">Market Leader</div>
          <h3>Full-Service</h3>
          <div class="pricing-range">~$7,000–$18,000/mo</div>
          <ul>
            <li>Elite Ads + Retargeting + Bing</li>
            <li>Elite SEO Level 3</li>
            <li>New Website + AI Chatbot</li>
            <li>Email + Social Media Marketing</li>
            <li>Bilingual SEO (optional)</li>
            <li>1:1 Performance Reporting</li>
            <li>Dedicated Client Strategist</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Apply CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Ready to Start Referring?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your audience and we'll set up your referral link, share tracking, and give you everything you need to start earning.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="mailto:patrick@goconstellation.com?subject=Partner Program Application" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Apply to Partner →</a>
        <a href="mailto:patrick@goconstellation.com?subject=Partner Program Question" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">Ask a Question</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
/* ==================== HERO ==================== */
.hero {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark) 0%, #16213e 100%);
  color: #fff;
  padding: 80px 0 72px;
}

.hero-inner {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.hero-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: rgba(79,188,133,0.2);
  color: var(--green);
  border: 1px solid rgba(79,188,133,0.4);
  padding: 6px 16px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 3.6rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.05;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.hero-sub {
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin-bottom: 32px;
}

.hero-cta {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.btn-ghost {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 12px 28px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  background: transparent;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
  border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  transition: all 0.2s;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.btn-ghost:hover {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
  color: #fff;
}

.hero-cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.hero-card {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
}

.hero-card-rate {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--green);
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.hero-card-label {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.hero-card-desc {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ==================== SECTIONS ==================== */
.section { padding: 80px 0; }

.section-header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 52px;
}

.section-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  background: rgba(79,188,133,0.1);
  color: var(--green);
  border: 1px solid rgba(79,188,133,0.3);
  padding: 5px 14px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.section-header h2 {
  font-size: 2.2rem;
  color: var(--gray-900);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.section-sub {
  color: var(--gray-500);
  font-size: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

/* ==================== REASONS ==================== */
.reasons-section { background: var(--gray-100); }

.reasons-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 24px;
}

.reason-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 28px 24px;
  border: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  transition: all 0.2s;
}
.reason-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--green);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-green);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.reason-icon {
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.reason-card h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--gray-900);
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.reason-card p {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  color: var(--gray-500);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

/* ==================== STEPS ==================== */
.steps-section { background: #fff; }

.steps-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
}

.step {
  display: flex;
  gap: 28px;
  padding: 32px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gray-200);
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.step-number {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  min-width: 48px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--green);
  color: #fff;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(79,188,133,0.35);
}

.step-content h3 {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  color: var(--gray-900);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.step-content p {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--gray-500);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

/* ==================== COMMISSION ==================== */
.commission-section { background: var(--gray-100); }

.commission-layout {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 56px;
}

.commission-rate-block {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 40px 48px;
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 600px;
  width: 100%;
  border: 2px solid var(--green);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-green);
}

.big-rate {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 5rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--green);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.big-rate-label {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: var(--gray-500);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.commission-list {
  list-style: none;
  text-align: left;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}

.commission-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: var(--gray-700);
  padding-left: 4px;
}

.commission-list li::before {
  content: "✓";
  color: var(--green);
  font-weight: 700;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 1px;
}

